  <section class="section shell content-columns">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">DEVELOPMENT STATUS</p><h2>In development</h2><p class="content-copy">The project reports ongoing development. No verified public installation release is listed, and the website does not treat a project-reported percentage as a measure of readiness.</p><p class="eyebrow">PUBLIC EVIDENCE STATUS</p><h3>Not verified</h3><p class="content-copy">The Aurora OS repository is private. This website has not independently reviewed its source implementation or a consolidated test report. Individual capabilities must be assessed against implementation and test evidence.</p></div>
    <div><p class="eyebrow">ENGINEERING DIRECTION</p><ul class="content-list"><li>From-scratch operating-system development in Rust</li><li>Capability-based authority model</li><li>Microkernel-oriented architecture</li><li>Constrained privileged responsibilities</li><li>Explicit service boundaries and verification</li></ul></div>
